      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Not much benefit to have avatar pedestal materials instanced since there really isn't a case where you would need them moving so you should always just have them static batched instead of instanced. Since instancing and static batching doesn't work at the same time with static batching taking the importance.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
