      "value": "Avatar Pedestals dont use Material at all, yes i know the Stand itself dose but you can delete the stand, that image above the stand is not a material, its a mix of GUI and Particle, and you should not be having the Stands of the avatar pedestal anyways. the stand is not used for anything but to know where its at.",
