      "value": "@{5b12d42e9ad122540bc69858|full_name}: Batching would also be a good idea if the prefab would just have it checked already by default. A lot of avatar worlds seem to drop FPS as soon as avatar pedestals are rendered because there are people in VRChat that start learning Unity because of the game. Some worlds are perfectly fine up until the pedestals are rendered which is a shame since that sort of information hardly ever gets around it seems.",
      "viewerReactions": null
