      "value": "@{5ae14b192f26cf1a6d66ba79|full_name}:  I said its a Mix of GUI and Particle\nthe avatar image is not a material it's a server based object, it is not an in unity material, you can remove the Stand thats under the image delete \"pedestal\" and your good it dose not use a Material, like the portals the avatar image is form the server not a material, after you load the image of the ID it no longer needs to load anymore, its a Particle for the X, Y, Z area and puts a GUI Element form the Servers to that X, Y, Z area the particle has no material because its only being used for Location and angle for the GUI of the Image of portal and avatar to be at. its a GUI and UI server Element using a X,Y,Z of a particle, it's not a Material at all. the GPU Instancing (witch should not be checked anyways) is on the Stand not the avatar image and you should not even have the Stand their when you upload it it should only be the avatar image.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
